      <uighur>qačarlaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хацарлах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XACARLA-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. and i. To cuff, slap; to freeze along the sides or banks (of a river, when the middle is not yet covered with ice).</definition>
